1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Today we have a special promise.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
She keeps that promise every year.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
It was a promise to meet under the starry sky.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
I have a small secret in my heart.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
No one knows that secret yet.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Tomorrow, the two of us will keep that promise.
